1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Bc5 5. Be3 { Defends the knight on d4. } 5... Qf6 { Black now attacks d4 three
times. } 6. c3 { A third defender, and the knight is safe. } 6... Nge7 7. Bc4 O-O 8. O-O Bb6 9. Nc2 d6 10. Bxb6 axb6 *
